<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-PRESIDENT'S XI 233-6 V INDIA (308) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PRESIDENT'S XI 233-6 V INDIA (308) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sri Lanka Board President's XI were 233-6 in reply to India's first innings of 308 at the close on the second day of their three-day game at the Saravanamuttu Stadium on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
